IMPORT prelude
IMPORT `kn-nouns`
IMPORT `kn-ch1`
IMPORT `kn-majority`
IMPORT `kn-majority-fixed`

-- Mishnah Kinnim: 3:2 AT A FIXED NUMBER OF OWNERS, FOR EVERY COUNT.  Generated by
-- tools/gen_fixed_arity.py; change the script, not this file.  Run with ./prove.sh, like
-- kn-obligations.l4, and not checked by ../check.sh, for the same reason.
--
-- kn-obligations.l4 proves the worst case for the sources' cases one at a time.  Here the number of
-- owners is fixed (two, three, five) and their pairs are anything, so each #ASSERT is a theorem about
-- every mixture of that size:
--   1. whatever the apportionment of half the birds above, at least twice the smallest majority are
--      valid (kn-majority-fixed.l4);
--   2. Reiss's division (Torah u-Madda Journal 9, 2000, section 6) is an apportionment of half the
--      birds above, and exactly twice the smallest majority are valid in it: so the bound is the least;
--   and, for two owners, 3. Koppel's and Reiss's majority is Bartenura's larger count.
-- Not stated to the solver: that Reiss's division is in whole birds when the counts are whole.  Each of
-- its values is 0, twice an owner's pairs, or twice the last owner's pairs less (all the pairs less twice
-- the chosen owners' pairs), so it is whole by construction; stated as FLOOR w EQUALS w, the solver
-- timed out at 120 s for every size (2026-11-03), so that step rests on this reading.
-- Each owner's valid count is the encoding's per-nest rule, which kn-obligations.l4 section F proves
-- equal to the rule the search uses.  The general theorem, for any number of owners, is not here: it
-- needs induction, which a solver does not do.

§ `Kinnim: 3:2 at a fixed number of owners`

GIVEN p IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A BOOLEAN
`a whole number of pairs` p MEANS ((FLOOR p) EQUALS p) AND (p AT LEAST 1)

§§ `Two owners`

-- Reiss's division, nest 1 of two: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 1 of two that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2) MINUS (2 TIMES 0)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2) MINUS (2 TIMES p2)) ELSE 0

-- Reiss's division, nest 2 of two: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 2 of two that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN 2 TIMES p2 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN (2 TIMES p2) MINUS ((`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2) MINUS (2 TIMES p1)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of two nests` p1 p2)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of two nests` p1 p2)) THEN 0 ELSE 0

ASSUME P21 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME P22 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME A21 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME A22 IS A NUMBER

-- 1. The bound, for every two owners and every apportionment of half the birds above.
#ASSERT ((`a whole number of pairs` P21) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P22) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P21 A21) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P22 A22) AND ((A21 PLUS A22) EQUALS (P21 PLUS P22))) IMPLIES (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P21 A21) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P22 A22)) AT LEAST (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of two nests` P21 P22)))

-- 2. Reiss's division puts between none and all of each owner's birds above, half of all the birds
-- above in total, and reaches the bound: for every count of at least one pair, whole or not.
#ASSERT ((P21 AT LEAST 1) AND (P22 AT LEAST 1)) IMPLIES ((((`the birds of nest 1 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 1 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22) AT MOST (2 TIMES P21))) AND (((`the birds of nest 2 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 2 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22) AT MOST (2 TIMES P22))) AND (((`the birds of nest 1 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22) PLUS (`the birds of nest 2 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22)) EQUALS (P21 PLUS P22)) AND (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P21 (`the birds of nest 1 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P22 (`the birds of nest 2 of two that Reiss's division puts above` P21 P22))) EQUALS (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of two nests` P21 P22))))

-- 3. For two owners, the smallest majority is the larger owner's pairs: Koppel's and Reiss's reading
-- and Bartenura's give the same number (Beller, Higayon 5, p. 156: for two women the two readings coincide).
#ASSERT ((`a whole number of pairs` P21) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P22)) IMPLIES ((`the smallest majority of two nests` P21 P22) EQUALS (max P21 P22))

§§ `Three owners`

-- Reiss's division, nest 1 of three: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
      p3 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 1 of three that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 p3 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES 0)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES p2)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p3) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p3 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES p3)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3))) ELSE 0

-- Reiss's division, nest 2 of three: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
      p3 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 2 of three that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 p3 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 2 TIMES p2 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p2) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES p1)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p3) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p3 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 2 TIMES p2 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p2) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE 0

-- Reiss's division, nest 3 of three: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
      p3 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 3 of three that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 p3 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 2 TIMES p3 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 2 TIMES p3 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 2 TIMES p3 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p3) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND (p3 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN (2 TIMES p3) MINUS ((`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3) MINUS (2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of three nests` p1 p2 p3)) THEN 0 ELSE 0

ASSUME P31 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME P32 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME P33 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME A31 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME A32 IS A NUMBER
ASSUME A33 IS A NUMBER

-- 1. The bound, for every three owners and every apportionment of half the birds above.
#ASSERT ((`a whole number of pairs` P31) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P32) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P33) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P31 A31) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P32 A32) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P33 A33) AND ((A31 PLUS A32 PLUS A33) EQUALS (P31 PLUS P32 PLUS P33))) IMPLIES (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P31 A31) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P32 A32) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P33 A33)) AT LEAST (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of three nests` P31 P32 P33)))

-- 2. Reiss's division puts between none and all of each owner's birds above, half of all the birds
-- above in total, and reaches the bound: for every count of at least one pair, whole or not.
#ASSERT ((P31 AT LEAST 1) AND (P32 AT LEAST 1) AND (P33 AT LEAST 1)) IMPLIES ((((`the birds of nest 1 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 1 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT MOST (2 TIMES P31))) AND (((`the birds of nest 2 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 2 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT MOST (2 TIMES P32))) AND (((`the birds of nest 3 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 3 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) AT MOST (2 TIMES P33))) AND (((`the birds of nest 1 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) PLUS (`the birds of nest 2 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33) PLUS (`the birds of nest 3 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33)) EQUALS (P31 PLUS P32 PLUS P33)) AND (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P31 (`the birds of nest 1 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P32 (`the birds of nest 2 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P33 (`the birds of nest 3 of three that Reiss's division puts above` P31 P32 P33))) EQUALS (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of three nests` P31 P32 P33))))

§§ `Five owners`

-- Reiss's division, nest 1 of five: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
      p3 IS A NUMBER
      p4 IS A NUMBER
      p5 IS A NUMBER
GIVETH A NUMBER
`the birds of nest 1 of five that Reiss's division puts above` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5 MEANS
    IF ((2 TIMES 0) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (0 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES 0)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p1) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (p1 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p2) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (p2 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES p2)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p3) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (p3 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES p3)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p4) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (p4 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES p4)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES p5) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND (p5 AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES p5)) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p4))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p3 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p4))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p3 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p4 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p4 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5))) ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p2 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p1 PLUS p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN 0 ELSE IF ((2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5)) AT MOST (`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) AND ((p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5) AT LEAST (`the largest minority of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5)) THEN (2 TIMES p1) MINUS ((`all the pairs of five nests` p1 p2 p3 p4 p5) MINUS (2 TIMES (p2 PLUS p3 PLUS p4 PLUS p5))) ELSE 0

-- Reiss's division, nest 2 of five: the first choice of owners that makes up the largest minority has all its birds below; the first owner not chosen takes what makes half; the rest are all above.
GIVEN p1 IS A NUMBER
      p2 IS A NUMBER
      p3 IS A NUMBER
      p4 IS A NUMBER
      p5 IS A NUMBER
