ASSUME A55 IS A NUMBER

-- 1. The bound, for every five owners and every apportionment of half the birds above.
#ASSERT ((`a whole number of pairs` P51) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P52) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P53) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P54) AND (`a whole number of pairs` P55) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P51 A51) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P52 A52) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P53 A53) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P54 A54) AND (`so many of a nest's birds could be above` P55 A55) AND ((A51 PLUS A52 PLUS A53 PLUS A54 PLUS A55) EQUALS (P51 PLUS P52 PLUS P53 PLUS P54 PLUS P55))) IMPLIES (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P51 A51) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P52 A52) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P53 A53) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P54 A54) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P55 A55)) AT LEAST (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of five nests` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)))

-- 2. Reiss's division puts between none and all of each owner's birds above, half of all the birds
-- above in total, and reaches the bound: for every count of at least one pair, whole or not.
#ASSERT ((P51 AT LEAST 1) AND (P52 AT LEAST 1) AND (P53 AT LEAST 1) AND (P54 AT LEAST 1) AND (P55 AT LEAST 1)) IMPLIES ((((`the birds of nest 1 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 1 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT MOST (2 TIMES P51))) AND (((`the birds of nest 2 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 2 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT MOST (2 TIMES P52))) AND (((`the birds of nest 3 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 3 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT MOST (2 TIMES P53))) AND (((`the birds of nest 4 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 4 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT MOST (2 TIMES P54))) AND (((`the birds of nest 5 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT LEAST 0) AND ((`the birds of nest 5 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) AT MOST (2 TIMES P55))) AND (((`the birds of nest 1 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) PLUS (`the birds of nest 2 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) PLUS (`the birds of nest 3 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) PLUS (`the birds of nest 4 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55) PLUS (`the birds of nest 5 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)) EQUALS (P51 PLUS P52 PLUS P53 PLUS P54 PLUS P55)) AND (((`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P51 (`the birds of nest 1 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P52 (`the birds of nest 2 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P53 (`the birds of nest 3 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P54 (`the birds of nest 4 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55)) PLUS (`the valid offerings of a nest of pairs with so many of its birds above` P55 (`the birds of nest 5 of five that Reiss's division puts above` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55))) EQUALS (2 TIMES (`the smallest majority of five nests` P51 P52 P53 P54 P55))))
